      "description": "Mobile navigation trigger; theme control adds a circular border and uses 36px size.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ghost\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\"><svg width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 2px);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;transition:color 150ms,background-color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);width:40px;padding:8px 16px;border:0;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--foreground));}.ds-ghost:hover{background:hsl(var(--accent));color:hsl(var(--accent-foreground));}.ds-ghost:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px hsl(var(--background)),0 0 0 4px hsl(var(--ring));}.ds-ghost:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-ghost{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Visible label and leading search icon; same field shell supports native selects.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-search\">Buscar repositório</label><div class=\"ds-field-wrap\"><svg class=\"ds-search-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Nome, descrição ou tecnologia…\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px;color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-field-wrap{position:relative;}.ds-search-icon{position:absolute;left:12px;top:14px;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));}.ds-field{width:100%;min-height:44px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--input));border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 2px);background:transparent;padding:0 12px 0 40px;font-size:14px;color:hsl(var(--foreground));caret-color:hsl(var(--primary));font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-field::placeholder{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));}.ds-field:focus-visible{border-color:hsl(var(--primary));outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-field-label{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-field-wrap{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-search-icon{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Desktop navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "text-link",
      "description": "Fine current-page underline and quiet inactive links.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"/projects\" aria-current=\"page\">Projetos</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"/about\">Sobre</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:16px;font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-nav-link{position:relative;padding:8px;font-size:14px;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms;}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"],.ds-nav-link:hover{color:hsl(var(--foreground));}.ds-nav-link::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:8px;right:8px;bottom:0;height:1px;background:currentColor;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 240ms ease;}.ds-nav-link:hover::after,.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]::after{transform:scaleX(1);}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-nav-link{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Topic label",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "topic",
      "description": "Static bordered project metadata, deliberately not an interactive chip.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-topic\">typescript</span>",
      "css": ".ds-topic{display:inline-block;max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-topic{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "text-link",
      "description": "Inline source and contact action, with a gently translating SVG arrow.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PedroRBC\">GitHub <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:hsl(var(--foreground));text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-link:hover{color:hsl(var(--primary));}.ds-link svg{transition:transform 240ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-link:hover svg{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-link{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project preview",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "project-preview",
      "description": "Square artwork and secondary information panel; sample uses the real repository name habits.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-preview\"><div class=\"ds-art\">habits</div><div class=\"ds-info\"><div><h3 class=\"ds-preview-title\">habits</h3><p class=\"ds-description\">Um projeto open source. Explore o código e os detalhes no GitHub.</p></div><a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PedroRBC\">Código <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(16rem,19rem);background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-art{display:flex;min-height:320px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;background:#dfe5d5;color:#3d4e32;font-size:clamp(2rem,5.8vw,5.5rem);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.1;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px;padding:32px;}.ds-preview-title{margin:0;font-size:28px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.15;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-description{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));}.ds-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:hsl(var(--foreground));text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-link:hover{color:hsl(var(--primary));}.ds-link svg{transition:transform 240ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-link:hover svg{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-preview{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}.ds-art{min-height:240px;font-size:clamp(2rem,10vw,4rem);}.ds-info{padding:24px;gap:24px;}.ds-preview-title{font-size:24px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-art{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-description{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-info{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-link{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-preview{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-preview-title{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project selector row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "project-row",
      "description": "Pressed-state selector with its own focus-revealed repository action. Preview updates require the application runtime.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row-wrap\"><button class=\"ds-row\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-row-name\">habits</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-row-actions\"><a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PedroRBC\">Código <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row-wrap{border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border));}.ds-row{display:flex;width:100%;min-height:62px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border:0;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));padding:16px 8px;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--foreground));transition:color 240ms ease,padding 320ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-row-name{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:21px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.25;}.ds-row:hover,.ds-row[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:hsl(var(--primary));padding-left:14px;}.ds-row svg{transition:transform 320ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-row[aria-pressed=\"true\"] svg{transform:rotate(45deg);}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}.ds-row-actions{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;}.ds-row-actions:focus-within{position:static;width:auto;height:auto;margin:0;overflow:visible;clip:auto;white-space:normal;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 20px;padding:0 8px 16px;}.ds-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:hsl(var(--foreground));text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-archivo, Archivo, sans-serif);}.ds-link:hover{color:hsl(var(--primary));}.ds-link svg{transition:transform 240ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-link:hover svg{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring));outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-link{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-row{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-row-actions{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-row-name{transition:none;animation:none;}.ds-row-wrap{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Project Index",
    "overview": "A direct, independent-studio portfolio: Archivo lettering, a warm paper canvas, charcoal ink, cobalt actions, thin separators, and rectangular project artwork. The work supplies the personality; presentation stays concise rather than competing with it.\n\nDensity comes from unboxed rows and compact metadata, balanced by generous section gaps. Dark mode preserves the hierarchy with green-charcoal neutrals and a lighter cobalt. Restrained motion acknowledges selection and navigation, without autoplay or looping decoration.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Name-led project discovery and factual GitHub content.",
      "Flat rectangular surfaces and fine structural rules.",
      "One sans-serif voice with tightly tracked headings.",
      "Pointer, touch, keyboard, theme, and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Cobalt Rule",
        "body": "Use the interface primary for actions and selection; keep project-artwork colors local to artwork.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Sans Voice Rule",
        "body": "Use Archivo for headings, prose, controls, and metadata; retain mono for code/data rather than introducing a second display voice.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep project content factual and name-led, with real GitHub banners or the shipped name fallback.",
      "Do preserve the same content hierarchy and interaction states across light and dark themes.",
      "Do keep project links directly reachable by keyboard and honor reduced motion.",
      "Do use tonal panels and structural rules for separation rather than decorative elevation."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn artwork colors into competing global action colors.",
      "Don't require hover to reach project selection or source/demo links.",
      "Don't replace static topic labels with controls unless filtering behavior is actually provided.",
      "Don't add autoplay or looping decoration to the restrained project-discovery interaction."
    ]
  }
}
